# Face of the Future (crystalWar 61) at the Batallia Downs Cavernous Maw beside the WotG mission Back to the Beginning
# (current by a GM; Claws of the Griffon completed, a GM: its requirement; its maw reply the Progress 501). A level 99
# Warrior in Batallia Downs [S] with Chasing Shadows completed and this quest accepted (GMs). The [S] maw unlocks the
# PAST_MAW bit 0 (shared with the Batallia Downs maw) before the mission is current (the mission answers the [S] maw
# too). Prog 6 by a GM: the maw's 504 (a Progress reply) ties 501: container order the first time, the rotation the
# next. The first round's mission finish is made to complete nothing (a GM completes the mission with its event open),
# then the mission and Prog are set back (GMs): the second tie in the zone plays the 504.
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/504
char zone=BatalliaDownsS pos=-48,0,435 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.ChasingShadows completed
quest CrystalWar.FaceOfTheFuture accepted
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon completed
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # the PAST_MAW bit 0 not held: the [S] maw's 100
finish option=1                         # the bit; setPos into Batallia Downs
tick 400
login                                   # the zone change: Batallia Downs
warp -48,0.1,435 BatalliaDowns          # the same spot: for the flow checker's zone
mission Wotg CavernousMaws completed    # a GM: the default current mission (it answers the maw 500)
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current # a GM
charvar Quest[7][61]Prog 6              # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # 504 and 501 tie: container order
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning completed # a GM, the event open: its finish completes nothing
finish
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current # a GM
charvar Quest[7][61]Prog 6              # a GM
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # the second tie in the zone plays the other
finish
